  "description": "Economical Professional Customization\n\nFRAMESET\n\nFrame\n\nTORAY T700 carbon fiber, 120mm travel, internal cable routing, post mount disc brake, 197x12 thru axle.\n\nFork\n\nDengFu suspension dual shoulder fork, 120mm travel, 1 1/8\"-1 1/2\"(OD62mm,ID56mm).\n\nSeat post\nAluminum seat post,31.6mm diameter, 350mm drop.\n\nHeadset\n\n1 1/8\"-1 1/2\"(OD62mm,ID56mm).\n\nMOTOR\n\nMotor\nBAFANG M620 1000W 48V CAN-BUS + shift sensor.\n\nBattery\nLithium-ion 48V 17.5Ah 840Wh, 4A fast charging.\n\nDRIVETRAIN\n\nRear Derailleur\nSRAM 12 RD X5 9S LONG CAGE BLK.\n\nCrankset\nBAFANG EB11 170mm 40T. double chain guard.\n\nCassette\nSRAM CS PG 920 11-34 9 Speed.\n\nShifters\nSRAM X5 TRIGGER REAR 9-SPD BLK 2200MM CABLE.\n\nBrakes\nAttack 4 Piston Brakes.\n\nWHEELSET\n\nWheels\nAluminum Alloy Snow wheel set+Chosen fat hub150x15/197x12+DT spokes, 32/32 holes.\n\nTyre\n\nKENDA 26erx4.0.\n\nCOMPONENTS\n\nRear Shock\nDNM 210x55 Air Cylinder (70mm), 32.3/16.8bush 70mm.\n\nHandlebar\nAluminum Swallow handle 800mm.\n\nStem\nAluminum 45mm.\n\nSaddle\nTTZ008 Comfortable Black.\n\nPedal\nAlloy pedals.\n\nFRAMESET\n\nFrame\n\nTORAY T700 carbon fiber, 120mm travel, internal cable routing, post mount disc brake, 197x12 thru axle.\n\nFork\nDengFu suspension fork, 120mm travel, 1 1/8\"-1 1/2\"(OD62mm,ID56mm).\n\nSeat post\nUDING suspension seat post, 150mm travel.\n\nHeadset\n\n1 1/8\"-1 1/2\"(OD62mm,ID56mm).\n\nMOTOR\n\nMotor\nBAFANG M620 48V 1000W CAN-BUS + shift sensor.\n\nBattery\nLithium-ion 48V 17.5Ah 840Wh, 4A fast charging.\n\nDRIVETRAIN\n\nRear Derailleur\nSRAM SX 12S.\n\nCrankset\nBAFANG EB11 170mm 40T.double chain guard.\n\nCassette\nSRAM SX 12S 12 Speed.\n\nShifters\nSRAM SX 12S.\n\nBrakes\nSRAM G2.\n\nChain\nSRAM SX 12S.\n\nWHEELSET\n\nWheels\n80mm Aluminum Alloy, Chosen Fat hub 150x15/197x12 quick release, 32/32 holes.\n\nTyre\nKENDA 26erx4.0.\n\nHandlebar\nAluminum Swallow handle 800mm.\n\nStem\nAluminum 45mm.\n\nSaddle\nComfortable, black FIZIK.\n\nPedal\nAlloy pedals.\n\nFRAMESET\n\nFrame\n\nTORAY T700 carbon fiber, 120mm travel, internal cable routing, post mount disc brake, 197x12 thru axle.\n\nFork\n\nDengFu suspension dual shoulder fork, 120mm travel, 1 1/8\"-1 1/2\"(OD62mm,ID56mm).\n\nSeat post\nKS seatpost, suspension seat post, 31.6mm diameter, 150mm drop\n\nHeadset\n\n1 1/8\"-1 1/2\"(OD62mm,ID56mm).\n\nMOTOR\n\nMotor\nBAFANG M620 48V 1000W CAN-BUS + shift sensor+front light cable( no light) + Bafang C18 display\n\nBattery\nLithium-ion 48V 17.5Ah 840Wh, 4A fast charging.\n\nCrankset\nBAFANG 40T. double chain guard.(Crank arms not included)\n\nBrakes\nMAGURA MT5 hydraulic brakes.\n\nWHEELSET\n\nWheels\nCarbon 80mm Snow wheel set+Chosen fat hub150x15/197x12+DT spokes, 32/32 holes.\n\nHandlebar\nAluminum Swallow handle 800mm.\n\nStem\nAluminum 45mm.",
